msgid "help_main_slide1_title"
msgstr "Practice"

msgid "help_main_slide1_text"
msgstr "Daily Mandala changes every day, is generated from today’s date, and is open to everyone.\n\nYou can use it for a short daily meditation or simply admire it as an art object."

msgid "help_main_slide2_title"
msgstr "Collection"

msgid "help_main_slide2_text"
msgstr "Your meaningful dates, minted as unique Mandala NFTs. Their images reflect specific dates, so they remain unchanged and are visible only to you on your watch."

msgid "help_main_slide3_title"
msgstr "Start your Collection"

msgid "help_main_slide3_text"
msgstr "To mint unique Mandala NFTs for your personal Collection:\nConnect your wallet, mint your Mandala, then link your wallet to your watch."

